{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game includes RPG content such as exploration, self building teams, battles, and growth, as well as multiplayer gameplay such as interacting with other players, forming guilds, and competing in battles. Players can cultivate their own characters, and their teams can freely explore the world map. They can explore different caves, sects, and strongholds, learn different martial arts, and recruit different characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Feature]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Open worldview and plot setting, free martial arts activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540830/extras/QQ\u622a\u56fe20250324110725.png?t=1744686123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Leisure gameplay mode, idle growth fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540830/extras/QQ\u622a\u56fe20250324110355.png?t=1744686123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Ultra high character engagement, recruiting and sparring with all NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540830/extras/QQ\u622a\u56fe20250324110630.png?t=1744686123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Multi directional partner pairing, high freedom cultivation and growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540830/extras/QQ\u622a\u56fe20250324110609.png?t=1744686123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Numerous anticipated follow-up features have been released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540830?t=1744686123","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540830/page_bg_raw.j